// Windows resources for HengbandHd2d.exe (the voxel HD2D screen).
//
// ASCII only on purpose: rc.exe reads this file with the machine's narrow
// code page (CP932 here), and a multi byte tail can swallow the next line.
// See and the memory note "rc.exe CP932 line ending trap".
//
// The icon is the same sword as the Android launcher icon; the shapes and
// colours come from android/hd2d/src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml
// and values/ic_launcher_background.xml. Regenerate it with the script kept in
// (icon section) if those change.
//
// Icon id 1: Explorer shows the icon with the lowest numeric id.
1 ICON "hd2d.ico"
